{"clips":[{"audio_s":2.65,"canal":"sync","escena":2,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena02-camila.mp4","texto":"Qué bueno que viniste, alguien tenía que servir.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena02-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":1.47,"canal":"vo","escena":3,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena03-elena.mp4","texto":"Mi prima se casa hoy.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena03-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.88,"canal":"vo","escena":4,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena04-elena.mp4","texto":"Con el hombre al que me vendieron.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena04-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":3.52,"canal":"vo","escena":5,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena05-elena.mp4","texto":"A los diecinueve, mi familia me vendió como novia por contrato.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena05-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":2.09,"canal":"vo","escena":6,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena06-elena.mp4","texto":"Hoy me pusieron a servir en su boda.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena06-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":2.13,"canal":"sync","escena":8,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena08-camila.mp4","texto":"La novia soy yo, por si se te olvida.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena08-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":1.62,"canal":"sync","escena":9,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena09-elena.mp4","texto":"Qué bonito anillo, prima.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena09-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.69,"canal":"sync","escena":10,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena10-camila.mp4","texto":"Costó más que todo lo tuyo.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena10-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":2.65,"canal":"vo","escena":11,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena11-elena.mp4","texto":"El anillo de mi abuela es lo único que me quedó.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena11-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.37,"canal":"sync","escena":12,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena12-camila.mp4","texto":"En mi boda, tú sirves.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena12-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":2.28,"canal":"vo","escena":14,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena14-elena.mp4","texto":"Mi madre nunca me defendió. Ni una vez.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena14-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.75,"canal":"sync","escena":15,"foto":"assets/faces/carmen.webp","personaje":"carmen","salida":"clips/escena15-carmen.mp4","texto":"Elena, no hagas escándalo.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena15-carmen.wav"},{"audio_s":1.45,"canal":"sync","escena":16,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena16-camila.mp4","texto":"Vete, aquí no sirves.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena16-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":0.64,"canal":"sync","escena":18,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena18-adrian.mp4","texto":"¿Elena?","wav":"assets/narracion/escena18-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":1.19,"canal":"sync","escena":19,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena19-elena.mp4","texto":"Soy yo, Adrián.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena19-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.75,"canal":"sync","escena":20,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena20-adrian.mp4","texto":"¿Qué haces sirviendo en mi boda?","wav":"assets/narracion/escena20-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":2.37,"canal":"sync","escena":21,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena21-elena.mp4","texto":"Lo mismo que hace ocho años: obedecer.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena21-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.6,"canal":"sync","escena":22,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena22-adrian.mp4","texto":"Nadie te vendió, Elena.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena22-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":1.24,"canal":"sync","escena":23,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena23-adrian.mp4","texto":"Tu familia firmó.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena23-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":1.07,"canal":"sync","escena":24,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena24-elena.mp4","texto":"Y tú pagaste.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena24-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":2.11,"canal":"sync","escena":25,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena25-adrian.mp4","texto":"Pagué por un contrato, no por ti.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena25-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":2.35,"canal":"sync","escena":26,"foto":"assets/faces/camila.webp","personaje":"camila","salida":"clips/escena26-camila.mp4","texto":"Adrián, no le hagas caso, es la sirvienta.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena26-camila.wav"},{"audio_s":1.13,"canal":"sync","escena":27,"foto":"assets/faces/adrian.webp","personaje":"adrian","salida":"clips/escena27-adrian.mp4","texto":"Cállate, Camila.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena27-adrian.wav"},{"audio_s":2.3,"canal":"vo","escena":29,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena29-elena.mp4","texto":"Ocho años obedeciendo, hoy se acabó.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena29-elena.wav"},{"audio_s":1.17,"canal":"sync","escena":30,"foto":"assets/faces/elena.webp","personaje":"elena","salida":"clips/escena30-elena.mp4","texto":"No me voy, ya no.","wav":"assets/narracion/escena30-elena.wav"}],"descripcion":"Manifiesto de clips SadTalker (CPU) del episodio 1. Una entrada por línea hablada del storyboard (25). El campo 'canal' viene del storyboard: 'sync' = el personaje habla en cámara (lip-sync imprescindible); 'vo' = voz en off (el clip sirve como plano de apoyo / cutaway en montaje). Las fotos son los rostros lock 1600x1600; los wav son la narración Kokoro ya generada (24 kHz, mono).","episodio":1,"parametros_sadtalker":{"batch_size":1,"cpu":true,"enhancer":null,"expression_scale":0.8,"preprocess":"full","